window.products.push({"id":321020,"name":"Olympic National Park, Washington Orca Giclee Art Print Poster from Illustration by Artist Matt Brass 24\" x 36\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hnmcgz+SL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","description":"With an artist mother and a lot of his childhood spent outdoors and traveling, Nashville-based artist Matt Brass was destined to create art depicting the best of the great American outdoors. This work of art is part of his ‚ÄúNeonaturalist ‚Äúseries of American National Parks and Wildernesses. The series is an homage to the original Depression-era Ranger Naturalist Service Series, which was part of the 1930s New Deal arts project. Matt hopes his series of more modern illustrations can revive the legacy and awareness of that original project, which were prints designed to highlight America‚Äôs natural wonders and encourage people to visit. Currently a creative director at an ad agency, Matt's work is driven by a passion for powerful communication and a love for the great outdoors. Art print posters are from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. They are professionally printed at our facilities in the United States on the highest quality art paper using premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist‚Äôs vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your art poster will make it a tremendous addition of your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall d√cor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hnmcgz+SL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B077XL1XQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077XL1XQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077XL1XQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":321021,"name":"Zelancio Titan X-1 Digital LCD Display Air Fryer with Rapid Air Fry Technology. Ultimate Healthy Multifunctional Cooker - Fry / Bake / Grill / Roast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OX6ZWaePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine if there was an alternative to cooking your favorite fried foods that left them tasting just as tasty, but without the extra fat and grease. WELL there is! the Delanco LCD display air fryer is the answer! it has the ability to give your favorite fried foods that delicious fried taste you love, without any of the harmful, diet ruining, disadvantages of actually frying your food. Foods and cooking methods that were previously off limits due to health concerns can be enjoyed guilt free with the Delanco air fryer healthy deep fryer. How does it work? the air fryer has a revolutionary fan technology that virtually eliminates unnecessary fats and oils. Using rapid air technology, the Delanco air fryer circulates hot air with speed for perfect frying results every time using less oil. While ensuring that your food is cooked throughout, evenly, and all sides by distributing the heat thoroughly. During the cooking process, oil drips into the basket below. The food then air fries by lifting the excess oil and coating the food while it is airborne. This results in delicious foods that have a fried Texture while eliminating the uses of oil and fat. Is the air fryer safe? a common concern is safety. The air fryer, however, has several safety features. For example, the air fryer turns off automatically once the food timer has reached 30 minutes worth of use, leaving your food cooked to perfection. This helps avoid the worry of leaving the fryer on for multiple hours and risking a fire hazard. Does it take up too much space? the air fryer is small enough to fit on your kitchen counter as a toaster would, but without interfering with your daily kitchen routine. The air fryer has easy to clean parts that can be simply wiped down or put into the dishwasher without ruining it. ORDER yours today with confidence!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OX6ZWaePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zelancio","source_asin":"B01M3PS3TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3PS3TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3PS3TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
