window.products.push({"id":321232,"name":"PARAROSE Mothers Day Rose Gifts for her, Handmade Rose Flowers in Box, Eternal Rose Gifts for Women, Birthday, Anniversary, for Mom Grandma Wife(3 Ros","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719VGaK1iqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹【Anniversary gift】Our preserved flowers is made of 100% handmade real nature fresh rose,perfectly and eternally stored in a box. It will never fade and wither. Eternal Flower expresses your eternal love to your Loved ones. ❤️【Eternal Rose & Always Fresh】Fresh roses will wither in a week or less.But our 100% preserved real roses can be stored for about 3-5 years without watering or other maintenance. However, they must be taken care to avoid direct sunlight and placed in a dry environment. 🎁【Best gifts for her】It is the perfect gift for wife, mother, girlfriend, daughter, grandma, friends on Birthday, Anniversary, Christmas, wedding, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Marriage Proposals, New Year's Day or other Holiday Occasions Gift ideas for Women. 💝【Exquisite Packaging】The romantic rose gifts has 3 real roses and came in a nice presentable and sturdy box with a ribbon. The rose flowers have decorated with gypsophila lace and can also be taken out and given to others. 🌹【 Unique Artwork】：The preserved flowers is an amazing symbol of lasting friendship, beauty and love. It's a perfect christmas idea for girlfriend or christmas present for wife. Tell our eternal love to her. Our roses for valentines day are the perfect romantic gift for your wife or girlfriend. Eternal rose is packaged in a beautiful gift box, so that you could give directly without spend time on package! ❤【 Delicate Hand-made】: Every exquisite flower box is carefully made by the florist of our flower shop  to carefully preserve the beauty of the rose. It's a perfect christmas ideas for girlfriend or christmas presents for wife. 🎁【Christmas Rose Gift & Mothers Day Gift】: Rose is the flower of love, and red rose is the symbol of passionate love and eternal love. Send this warm and bright red Mothers day roses to express unlimited love to mom or lovers.. 💌【Hand-made Instructions】Our flowers are handmade with real roses. There may be slight differences between each product. If you have any questions, please contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719VGaK1iqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARAROSE","source_asin":"B0BLV7T7CW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLV7T7CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLV7T7CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
