window.products.push({"id":321316,"name":"Marquess Box Spring Cover- Wrap Around Elastic, Vertical Stripe Pattern Bed Skirt Alternative, and Classic 15\" Drop Length. Polyester/Polyester Fillin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mVTfEzOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MARQUESS is a professional brand home textile company. MARQUESS Box Spring Cover stands out with great quality and a much neater look, which would not drag the ground and covers the box spring very nicely. HOW TO INSTALL IT BY ONE PERSON? STEP 1: You need to fasten the Velcro at the end of the box spring cover. The Velcro is very strong so no worries about it coming off.  STEP 2: For the first time install, need two men to pull the edge of the box spring cover to make the elastic belt to much loosen and not too firm to easy put on and curls up evenly. It's best to put your arm in the ring formed by the box spring cover so that it's easy to pull it hard. (This step is just needed for the first time install.) STEP 3: Put the box spring cover on the two corners of the mattress, and then put the other two corners in turn.  STEP 4: Finally, the fixed snap is selected according to the size of the bed. The buttons on both sides make the box spring cover tighter, not loose, and protect your box.  STEP5: You can see the method in image 3 above. You don't have to lift the top mattress to put on the box spring cover. ^-^ CARE INSTRUCTION: Warm gentle machine wash, wash dark colors separately. Do not bleach, do not tumble dry, do not iron, do not dry clean, rinse well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mVTfEzOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marquess","source_asin":"B07PCPPKW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PCPPKW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PCPPKW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
