window.products.push({"id":321416,"name":"Solino Home Cotton Linen Curtain – White 52 x 132 Inch, 2 in 1 Hanging Style Curtain with Rod Pocket and Hidden Tab – Curtain for Spring, Summer, Indo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814KTY8lDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Linen Curtain, woven of a luxurious blend of pure linen and cotton. Size - 52(W) x 132(L) Inch. Our curtain 2-in-1 construction offers two hanging options: 3” rod pocket and 3” hidden back tab feature and finished with a 4” hem. One panel per box, Unlined. Hand-crafted by skilled artisans with the finest details to provide privacy, while filtering incoming natural light. No lining. Easy care - Machine washable on gentle cycle, tumble dry on low and remove promptly. Warm iron as needed, steam iron for a crisp look. Use only non-chlorine bleach. Like all fine linens and textiles, each batch of our cotton linen is different and unique. Slight color, texture variations and wrinkles are an inherent quality of handcrafted pieces, adding to their relaxed beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814KTY8lDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solino Home","source_asin":"B09PVDV2D9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PVDV2D9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PVDV2D9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
