window.products.push({"id":321660,"name":"COKTIK 5 in 1 Insulated Can Cooler, Double Wall Slim Can Cooler for 12 oz Regular or Slim Cans & Beer Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8tHd2NvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 IN 1 VERSATILITY DESIGN - Unique can cooler with 5 sizes in 1 design fits your favorite 12oz regular cans, slim cans, and beer bottles all in one. No more switching insulated coolers! Besides, it can also be used as a smoothie cup or 14oz travel tumbler with lid. Drink whatever size of drink you want! NO DROP TECHNOLOGY-Our stainless steel can cooler feathers a lid design. Just simply install the rubber top, place your can and bottle inside and cover it back on. You won't have to worry about your beer bottle falling out of the Insulated cooler. KEEP COLD LONGER: Made of 304 stainless steel and constructed with double-walled vacuum, which keeps ice cold for 8 hours and beer beverage 20x colder than a standard neoprene can cooler and refreshing till your last drop. BONUS ACCESSORIES: COKTIK insulated can cooler set comes with 1 sliding lid . We have equipped a cup brush for a single cup, 2 for a four pack, and 4 for an eight pack.You can use it as a smoothie cup or as a travel tumbler. SWEAT-FREE & NON-SLIP - The exterior surface of our Slim beer cooler will stay completely dry no matter how cold your drink is, your hands will keep dry. A non-slip base can make your drink avoid slipping or sliding around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8tHd2NvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COKTIK","source_asin":"B0C39WWCQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C39WWCQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C39WWCQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":321661,"name":"2x2 36 pcs Yellow Talavera Mexican Tile","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317DJHfz1xL._AC_.jpg","description":"This ceramic tile is hand-painted in a washed yellow color. In the manufacturing process the whole tile is painted in white as a first step and then the rest of the tile is painted on top of the white one, so the coloring of this tile is named as yellow over white or washed yellow. This tile can be used as a field piece in a decorative wall as shown in the second picture. DISCLAIMER: All of our ceramic tiles have a heavily hand-made process involved; as such, imperfections are expected. Color variations are to be expected from batch to batch. What you see on your screen might not be exactly what you will get, this is mostly due to several factors, among others: lighting when the picture was taken, lighting in your own monitor, but mostly changes in the glazes used between batches. All these factors are beyond our control. If in doubt, we recommend you to order a sample before committing to a bigger order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317DJHfz1xL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Crafts Imports","source_asin":"B00VVWJ0H0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VVWJ0H0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VVWJ0H0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
