window.products.push({"id":321697,"name":"Miele Vacuum Cleaner Belt for S170 and S180 Series (2 pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHSe792yL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Miele vacum cleaner belt S170-S180 1 belt only! Genuine Miele brush drive belt (OEM) NOTE: When replacing the brush drive belt be sure the brush turns freely or the new belt WILL fail! (Check the brush bearings [ both ends] for wrapped up hair, thread, string etc...) Also clean any old rubber residue from the motor shaft (this is inportant to allow some slippage) a small wire brush or steel wool even very fine grit sandpaper works well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHSe792yL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miele","source_asin":"B0002U371C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002U371C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002U371C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
