window.products.push({"id":321699,"name":"nioBomo 100% Luxury Shiny Silkly Satin Cotton Pillowcase Pillow Covers for Hair and Facial Skin, Silky Soft, Standard Queen & King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMxZoEjvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Brand nioBomo.  nioBomo is a professional manufacturerfocusing on the design, development and produce in home textil and bedding. Description 1.HIGH QUALITY - Made of 100% microfiber polyester, satin cotton, fabric weight 100g,which gives it its smooth finish and exceptional longevity, even after extensive wash and wear. Wrinkle free, stain and fade resistant, durable.  2.COMFORTABLE - Satin pillowcases are silky soft against your skin, reducing facial creases and wrinkles. Satin pillow cases also keep your hair safe from harm, preventing matting, breakage, tangling and snagging. Sleep better with comfortable pillowcases, you will wake up each morning with healthy skin and beautiful hair. 3.EASY TO CARE FOR - Wrinkle free, No ironing necessary, Machine Washable and tumble dry low. The envelope closure prevents slipping and ensures that the pillow stays perfectly in the pillowcase. 4.MULTIPLE CHOICE - Full Size Standard Pillowcases (Standard 20” x 26”,Queen 20” x 30”and King 20” x 40”). With our fabulous selection of colors, you're sure to find a satin pillowcase to match your decor. Colors: white, black, purple, green blue, gold, pink, silver. Material 100% polyester, sation cotton. Fabric weight 110g  Weft yarn weave:100*48F 300*288F Size Standard: 20\" x 26\" (51cm x 66cm)  Queen: 20\"x 30\" (51cm x 76cm)  King: 20\"x 40\" (51cm x 102cm) Color Purple/White/Black/Silver/Blue/Yellow/Pink Package Pillowcase x 2pcs 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We believe that you will love this Satin Pillowcase as much as we do. But in case you don't, we offer a 100% money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMxZoEjvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nioBomo","source_asin":"B07566VLGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07566VLGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07566VLGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
