window.products.push({"id":321744,"name":"Set of 2--Pyrex Glass Drinking Straws, one blue, one green + cleaning brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KhvdrW+DL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"PROTECTS All OF US FROM TOXINS -Plastics can contain many dangerous chemicals one being BPA, which has been linked to hormonal disruption,obesity, early puberty, as well as breast and prostate cancers. Also the coloring in plastic straws can be poisonous. All glass straws are 100% non-toxic and will not cause any health problems! HELPS PREVENT STAINED TEETH & REDUCE CAVITIES -Research has shown that using a straw can minimize the contact between your teeth and sugary drinks, minimizing the risk of cavities. For the same reason, using a straw also helps to prevent tooth stains from tea and coffee and drink dye. Also plastic straws can't be used in hot drinks, but glass straws can, GREAT for soup or coffee… RESISTANT TO BREAKING - Remember those nearly indestructible Pyrex bowls and plates your mother has and are used in professional kitchens? These are made of the same material! Naturally clear, this borosilicate glass is very strong, making it safe and great for drinking. CLEANS SIMPLY -Easily rinse them out after each use and you're ready to use again. However included is a cleaning brush just in case you get some gunk or fruit from your smoothie wedged in there. Glass Straws are also dishwasher safe, it doesn't get any better than that! Don't add to daily pollution and risk your health and others by using plastic straws-get a Glass Straw Set Now! We guarantee your satisfaction or your money back. HELPS THE PLANET -People in the U.S. use Millions of plastic straws Every day. Plastic being not biodegradable, so every plastic straw that has been used since they were invented is still in a land fill, spreading toxic chemicals into the environment. The good news, just one person switching to a Glass Straw can keep some of the nasty plastic out of the environment forever! Now think of the difference you can make if you give a glass straws to a friend or family member.Thanks for your help saving the earth one little bit at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KhvdrW+DL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thestrazspot","source_asin":"B00BWYCSRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWYCSRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWYCSRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
