window.products.push({"id":321761,"name":"Aviv Judaica Disposable Passover Seder Plate 10.5\" Floral Design Durable Plastic - Multi Pack Round Pesach Seder Plates Passover Table Decorations (2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wa0PPAIlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seder plates for all! This year everyone will feel part of the Seder, family and friends, from oldest to youngest alike, no matter how many guests show up, always have enough plates available. Quality Seder Plates - Made from heavy duty durable plastic, these decorated disposable seder plates will make your seder preparation and clean up hassle free. Spring Time - Passover, not just a Holiday but the turn of a season. Spring brings along the exhilaration of renewal and celebration of Freedom. Decorate your Seder table with settings that reflect the moment. This uniquely designed Floral Spring Seder plate expresses just that. These round throw away passover trays are fully functional Seder Plates with 6 slots marked with the names of the traditional Passover Seder Symbols in Hebrew and English - Shankbone, Egg, Bitter Herbs, Charoset (haroset), Persley, Lettuce. Zroah, Baitzah, Marror, Charoset, Karpas, Chazeret Zion Judaica - Where tradition meets innovation. The most trusted name in Judaica for all your Passover Seder essentials and year round Judaica needs for every Jewish occasion and celebration. Shabbos, Yom Tov, Pesach, Chanukah. Bris Wedding Bar / Bat Mitzvah and more. Satisfaction Guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wa0PPAIlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aviv Judaica","source_asin":"B08XY5B22M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY5B22M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY5B22M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":321762,"name":"Avery Despicable Me Glue Stic, Washable, Nontoxic, Permanent Adhesive, 0.26oz, 6 Glue Sticks (00146)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xu-F4wreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Securely glue paper, cardboard, photos and more with the Avery Glue Stic, featuring the officially licensed Despicable Me Minions designs. Just lift the cap and twist the base for smooth, easy application. Great for crafting, scrapbooking and other projects. Acid-free, nontoxic glue stick is safe for school, home and office, and the adhesive easily washes off hands and clothing. Carl, Phil and Jerry are just a few of the Minions from the Despicable Me films that are here to help keep you organized. Coordinated Despicable Me dividers, binders and two-pocket folders are also available. Bring the whole team together to make this school year a blast! Your Despicable Me Minions glue sticks are not only great for school and classroom projects, but can also be used to glue mementos in your Despicable Me journal or even as Minions party favors! ACMI certified. Conforms to ASTM D 4236.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xu-F4wreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVERY","source_asin":"B07CW2K1V3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CW2K1V3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CW2K1V3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":321763,"name":"RealCool Insulated Lunch Bag for Women/Men, Lunch Box, Lunch Tote Bag, Leakproof Lunch Cooler with Buckle, Removable Shoulder Strap, for Work/Office/P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d0lMq9oeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Food Fresh and Warm】The exterior of the cooler bag is constructed from high density water-resistant dirt-proof Oxford fabric. The inner layers are made of thicker, reinforced BPA free,food-grade PEVA materials with seamless ultrasonic welding for 100% leakproof and tear resistance.A built-in 5mm EPE foam middle layer and 210D liner add additional insulation, allowing the Realcool lunch bag to keep food cold/warm for 8-10hours. 【Multi Compartments】It has 1 main zipped compartment for lunch, bread,yogurt etc, 1 front zippered pocket for your keys, cards, phone or other small stuffs, 1 back velcro pocket for plates and napkins, 2 mesh pockets for cold water and your hot coffee, 1 internal mesh pocket for utensils, snacks. Size:10.6\"L x 6.3\"W x 7.9\"H.Enough to store 12 cans of cola (330 ml).Easily folds to save storage space. Neither too big nor too small just the right size and space. 【Leakproof & SAB Double Zip】These insulated lunch bag is made of ultra-thick soft lining and hot-welded seams, no worries about ice cubes melting or sauce leaking any more. Waterproof Oxford cloth protects your lunch and food inside from occasional splatters or light rain. The portable lunch box features high quality metal SBS double zip to ensure easy slide. 【 Easy to Carry】The reusable lunch box is designed with a detachable & adjustable padded soft shoulder strap that can be adjusted from 15\" to 27\". Portable and lightweight with handle, convenient to carry and hold. you can easily enjoy using our work lunch bag as a modern fashion handbag, great shoulder bag or a cool crossbody bag. Specially designed buckle at the handle allows it to be attached to other bags. 【Versatile Bag】It can be also used as a cooler bag, a hand tote or a camping bag or simply use it as a grab-and-go bag to work or shopping. Small and portable, Great for offices. Also suitable for outdoor activities such as fishing, hiking, picnics, etc. Suit for all groups, including office workers, women, men and adults. It is also a great gift idea. If you are not 100% satisfied with our lunch bag, please contact us and we will solve any problem for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d0lMq9oeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RealCool","source_asin":"B0C5R9J9M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5R9J9M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5R9J9M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
