window.products.push({"id":321806,"name":"PARACITY Coffee Grinder/Spice Grinder Electric with 12 Cup Large Capacity, 150W Coffee Grinder Electric Stainless Blade Mill with Brush&Spood for Spic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dXj4K-NPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SILENT ELECTRIC GRINDER】This powerful grinder grinds fast and is quieter than other grinders. Coffee and spice grinders can be very quiet. Get up early to grind coffee beans and spices without disturbing your family's morning sleep. 【SUS 301 STAINLESS STEEL BLADES】The blades used in this electric herb grinder are SUS 301 stainless steel blades. This is a high strength food grade stainless steel obtained by cold working. Food grade material, safe. Does not rust. Sharper and stronger than ordinary 304 stainless steel blades. The electric herb grinder has a power of 150 W and rotates up to 24,150 rpm. Grind finer. 【ONE-TOUCH KEY OPERATION】Safety lock for added security, the coffee grinder will not start unless the cover is locked in place. This electric spice grinder is one-touch button operation. Once the lid is locked, with just one finger, you can press the button and wait for the coffee to grind. The casing of this electric spice grinder is transparent and made of high-transparent acrylic material, you can rest assured when you see it. 【LARGE-CAPACITY, CONVENIENT AND STYLISH】The electric herb grinder has a large capacity bean bin. You can add enough herb to grind. But the herb grinder itself is small, takes up less counter space, and features an understated and luxurious design with a premium black and gold ring for a noble and mysterious visual effect. Outdoor placement is a good option. 【MULTIFUNCTIONAL GRINDER】The herb grinder or spice grinder is designed with fine processing and passed multiple rated voltage tests, which is of high quality and safer. Electric coffee grinders can be used to grind herbs, spices, grains, peanuts, nuts, peppercorns, and more. 【SAFE AND RELIABLE】The lid has a safety lock, so the beans won't splash when grinding. You don't have to be around all the time to use it. 5420 high-quality all-copper wire design, durable, with overheating automatic power-off protection. Safer to use. This product comes with a one-year warranty, if you have any questions, you can contact us. We promise worry-free after-sales!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dXj4K-NPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARACITY","source_asin":"B0B211DG1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B211DG1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B211DG1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
