window.products.push({"id":321870,"name":"Pillowflex Set of 2 (28x28) Premium Polyester Pillow Inserts - Square Pillow Forms, Machine Washable, Sham Pillow Insert, Down Throw Pillow Insert, Sq","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71miW+8JQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"65/35 Polyester Cotton Blend Made in USA SOFT YET SUPPORTIVE - Add a touch of class to your living space with our perfect pillow inserts, providing softness, support and ideal loft. You'll be sure to give your living space a cozy and warm feeling with these soft and luxurious throw pillows for the couch. PACK OF 2 - Pillowflex Premium Polyester Pillow Inserts offer a dream-like comfort and are the perfect decorative touch to any sofa or bedding set. Crafted with a 65/35 polyester-cotton blend, these square pillows are sure to add a touch of class to your home's decor. SIZING GUIDE - Use the sizing chart image to select the best size inserts for your shams. For best results, it is important to ensure that your insert is larger than your sham, this will ensure that your pillow will have a full, plump and attractive appearance. EASY CARE - Our Pillowflex pillows offer loft, and softness like a fluffy cloud. Plus, they're machine washable and odorless, making them convenient for decorating and for enjoying cozy comfort. Lay your head down on one of our fluffy pillows for ultimate comfort. MADE IN USA - This high quality pillow, made from sustainably sourced fiber shell and a mix of polyester and cotton offer durability, comfort and support that you can depend upon. Quality construction guarantees that the product will last you a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71miW+8JQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillowflex","source_asin":"B075TJPDH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075TJPDH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075TJPDH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":321871,"name":"AIRMATE Bladeless Fan & HEPA Filter Air Purifier 2in1 with Remote, Silent 45”Oscillating Pedestal Fan, 5 Modes 24 Speeds, LED Display, 15H Timer, Auto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":459.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518gm637iuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃【2-in-1 Air Purifier and Tower Fan】Airmate oscillating tower fan ensures effective airflow distribution in the room thanks to its 60°/120° wide angle oscillation and 180m/min velocity. You can also enjoy clean air within 12 minutes with the inbuilt Airmate HEPA Air Purifier that refreshes air 5x per hour even in rooms as large as 219 ft² 🍃【Ideal for Allergies and Pet Owners】Airmate air purifiers avoid using UV-C light, an air purifying method that produces harmful ozone and secondary pollution based on research. True HEPA filter captures 99.9% particles as small as 0.3 micron, such as dust, smoke, pollen, etc. Breathe freely as the active carbon filter reduces formaldehyde and odors from pets, smoking, and cooking 🍃【15H Timer & 30dB Lowest Noise】This powerful yet silent floor fan is expertly engineered to emit only 30dB of noise! A built-in timer can be set from 1 to 15 hours, and the screen light will automatically turn off if not used in 30 seconds, immersing you in a relaxing night’s sleep free from disturbing lights and noises 🍃【5 Models & 24 Speeds】Stay cool during hot summer days! Choose from 5 modes (Turbo, Soft, Natural, AI Breeze, and Jet Flow Wind), and 24 speed levels according to your preference. The AI Smart Wind feature helps you adjust fan speed according to room temperature. Compact and portable, you can easily carry it to your bedroom, study, or office 🍃【Bladeless Fan Technology】This floor tower fan provides fresh air without rotating blades, its bladeless design will not hurt pets and babies. It provides a well dispersed gentle breeze instead of the old-school jet-focused air flow, and covers up to 590 sq.ft 🍃【Easy Operation, No Assembly Required】This bladeless tower fan is transported as a whole machine and can be used immediately without assembly. Strong packaging materials are used to ensure safe transportation. It's also easy to clean, just wipe the surface with a rag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518gm637iuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIRMATE","source_asin":"B09PVBZ2RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PVBZ2RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PVBZ2RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
