window.products.push({"id":321966,"name":"Double Curtain Rods 36-72\", Matte White Double Curtain Rods with Cap Finials, Adjustable 1 Inch Front and 5/8 Inch Back Double Drapery Rod, Telescopin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IdQGpiBhL._AC_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE DRAPERY ROD: Made of durable metallic iron, 1\" diameter on front rod for the main thick panels; 5/8\" diameter on back rod for sheer panels. The design of widening the distance between the two curtain rods allows the curtain to be pulled more smoothly without any fight. Double curtain rods constructions creates a layered look, add elegant to your windows and decorate home perfectly. TELESCOPIC STRUCTURE: Our double window rod is adjustable and extends from 36 to 72 inches easily, apply to windows with different sizes and supports light to medium weight curtains. Classic zinc alloy cylindrical cap end appearance shows the beauty of the decorative design. Ideal for the living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, or home office. STRONG AND DURABLE: Double curtain rod bracket are made of high-quality aluminum alloy, strong and sturdy, which can hold up to 30 lbs of weight easily and safely. Each rod is treated by high-tech paint baking process, which is special beautiful and durable. Double rod curtain rod set offers simple, classic style for your window decor in a durable iron construction. EASY TO INSTALL: Matte white double curtain rod 36-72\" packed with 1 set of front rod (2pcs rods), 1 set of back rod (2pcs rods), 4 cap ends, 3 double brackets, 1 set of screws & anchors and instructions. You can easily install double curtain rod in just a few steps. Decorative cap finials on either end provide a visually balanced beauty of the modern design. BEAUTIFUL AND PRACTICAL: Put the sheers on the back rod and the blackout curtains on the front rod. So you can choose to open your room darkening curtains, but still have the option to filter light through sheer curtains. Comes with 5 colors (Matte Black, Bronze, Brushed Nickel, Brass, Matte White) and 2 dimensions (36-72\", 72-144\"). Any questions, feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IdQGpiBhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosmile","source_asin":"B0BQXK6JBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-321966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQXK6JBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQXK6JBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
